ar vision assessment"},{"text":"Contact-lens fitting fundamentals"},{"text":"Ocular health screening"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Diagnostic Competence"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Slit-lamp examination"},{"text":"Tonometry"},{"text":"Visual-field testing"},{"text":"Fundus examination awareness"},{"text":"OCT/retinal imaging awareness"},{"text":"Recognition of findings requiring referral"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Patient-Care Competence"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patient history"},{"text":"Clinical communication"},{"text":"Prescription counselling"},{"text":"Contact-lens education"},{"text":"Pediatric communication"},{"text":"Follow-up management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional Competence"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clinical documentation"},{"text":"Ethical practice"},{"text":"Interdisciplinary communication"},{"text":"Referral management"},{"text":"Infection control"},{"text":"Continuous professional development"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Optom","Clinical Internship","Optometrist","Advanced Clinical Experience","Specialty Optometry","Senior/Lead Optometrist"]},{"type":"p","text":"For the strongest long-term profile, combine advanced refraction + ocular health screening + contact lenses + pediatric/myopia management + modern diagnostic technology + digital/AI-assisted eye-care awareness. This creates a versatile Optometrist profile suitable for hospitals, eye-care centres, optical organizations, community programs, research and eventually independent clinical practice."}]}]}